00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:35.320
But isn't it a bit early to be buying a swimsuit?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.360
It's only April!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.280
It's not early.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.240
I'm aiming for the prefecture tournament this year,

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.290
in the swimming race, so I need to have some fighting spirit.

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:45.650
I see.

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:47.170
You're in the swimming club.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.600
Eh?

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:52.000
Haven't I told you that before?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.380
Oh yeah, there's a swimming club, right?

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:56.740
Eh?

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:58.300
Ah, well...

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.970
I guess I'll choose the Kyoasu brand.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.070
Eh?

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:06.110
Apart from making cameras and mobile phones,

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:07.940
Kyoasu also makes swimwear?

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:08.850
Didn't you know?

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.900
Kyoasu's new products have been out for a while and have a good reputation.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.100
I see.

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:19.240
Before you know it, they're not only making delicate equipment,

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.120
but dabbling into sports wear as well.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:26.910
It looks like they might become our strong rivals someday.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.120
Um, Shougo?

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:35.880
Damn.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:38.010
I thought it was going to rain...

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.510
If I'm going to get this wet,

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.640
I may as well wear the swimsuit that I bought.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.810
Geez, I'm getting wet!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.190
That's not good!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.110
Watch out!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.150
Are you all right?

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.110
Y-Yeah...

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.660
Hey, is this okay?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.460
This flat is a dormitory for girls, right?

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.920
You protected me, and you're soaking wet.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.420
There's no way I'd let you go home like this.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.580
Hey, hey!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:17.920
Have a shower!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.470
You can put your clothes into the tumble dryer to dry them.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.930
No, there's no need to-

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.100
Just do it!

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:26.710
If you don't hurry up, you're going to catch a cold.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.350
Ah, you can leave the water in the bath,

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.300
because I'm going in after you.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.820
Miyabi, there's one thing I have to say.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:36.860
What is it?

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.070
Don't put on my underwear after I take it off.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:46.660
Let's fill up the bath with water first.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:52.040
This is Ganizeus?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.300
What?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.210
Why are there Gran Belion goods here?

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:00.220
Why would Miyabi have something so old?

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:03.930
Don't tell me...

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.600
...Miyabi is actually my little sister?

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.430
So does that mean, back then...

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.690
<i>I am your little sister.</i>

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:16.400
Eh?

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.270
Haven't you filled the bath with water yet?

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.240
Why are you...

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.720
Does it suit me?

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.740
Since you were looking at it with so much enthusiasm,

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.120
I thought I'd wear it for you.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:31.500
What's the matter?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.500
Since I went into the trouble of wearing it for you,

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.460
aren't you going to say if you like it or not?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:40.460
<i>I've come to marry you.</i>

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:51.180
Miyabi, can I ask you one thing?

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.480
What is it?

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.850
Who do you want to marry?

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.400
Why are you suddenly...

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.530
It was a serious question.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.900
Please answer it properly.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.620
Isn't it obvious?

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.210
It's you.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:18.630
It's always been you.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.340
So that means...

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:30.970
Miyabi, I'm happy that you feel like that.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.140
T-Then, Shougo, right now-

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.140
However, it's impossible.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.520
I cannot be your lover.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.780
After all, aren't we siblings?

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.580
Go home.

00:21:56.320 --> 00:21:57.290
Miyabi.

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:43.150
Hey Rinka-chan!

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:44.560
How do you make babies?

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:47.070
Um, that's...

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:48.110
That's right!

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:50.860
It would be better to ask the teacher about things like that.

00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:52.980
Why do I have to ask the teacher about that?

00:23:52.980 --> 00:23:55.280
Anyway, the preview, the preview!

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:58.450
Next time, episode 4: The Little Sister's Hero is Her Big Brother!

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:01.080
Since you said it so well, here's a reward!

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:01.740
Yay!

00:24:01.740 --> 00:24:03.340
A potato chip!

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:08.590
Speaking of which, there was something I wanted to know,

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:09.970
but what was it...?
